    <summary>Represents a trigger that initiates a peripheral customization action.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Represents a trigger that initiates a peripheral customization action.</para>
      <para>This is an abstract base class. Use specific subclasses like KeyCustomizationTrigger to represent different types of input triggers.</para>
